        "text_deWkFV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kessaris in Athens is an exclusive retailer of Shamballa Jewels, located in the heart of the city, where luxury and elegance meet. Known for its exceptional collection of fine jewelry and timepieces, Kessaris offers an immersive experience for clients seeking unique, hand-crafted Shamballa creations. Step into the world of refined artistry as you explore our signature bracelets, necklaces, and rings, crafted with meticulous attention to detail. At Kessaris, you’ll enjoy personalized service in a luxurious setting, making it the perfect destination to discover your next Shamballa Jewels piece in Athens.</p><p><strong>Opening hours:</strong><br/>Mon, Wed, Sat: 10.00-17.00<br/>Tue, Thu, Fri: 10.00-20.00<br/>Sunday and Holidays: Closed</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.gr/maps/place/KESSARIS+JEWELLERY/@37.9769907,23.7355676,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x14a1bd3eccc2dcbd:0xffad4cd25bb26584!8m2!3d37.9769907!4d23.7355676!16s%2Fg%2F11bxc5ylrl?hl=en&entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTAyMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Kessaris Athens\">7 Panepistimiou (El. Venizelou) Str.<br/>105 64 Athens, Greece</a></p>",
