          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kessaris at Nammos Village is an exclusive destination for Shamballa Jewels, set amidst the vibrant luxury of Mykonos. Located in the prestigious Nammos Village shopping area, this boutique brings the essence of Shamballa’s hand-crafted, iconic jewelry to life. Visitors can explore our unique collections, from signature bracelets to exquisite necklaces and rings, each piece blending spiritual symbolism with luxurious materials. Enjoy the personalized service and sophistication that Kessaris is known for, making it the ideal place to discover Shamballa Jewels in the heart of Mykonos' most luxurious shopping venue.</p><p><strong>Opening hours:</strong><br/>Closed during winter season</p><p><a href=\"https://www.google.gr/maps/place/Kessaris+@+NAMMOS/@37.4156714,25.3017784,13z/data=!4m8!1m2!2m1!1sKESSARIS+@+NAMMOS!3m4!1s0x14a2be8b8199684d:0xe0e192bc57c9ce39!8m2!3d37.4156714!4d25.3367973?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Kessaris Nammos\">Nammos Village, Psarrou<br/>84600 Mykonos, Greece</a></p>",
